  "limits": [
    "Source-only projection; no public WAVs, runtime dispatch, save state or application identity changes.",
    "Composite audio suffixes belong to MasterYiPassive; MasterYiDoubleStrike omits them. The parent omits the material flag while the secondary explicitly enables it. Native script callback timing and material propagation remain unverified.",
    "Both hit actions retain their shared four branch containers/caps and independent zero/200ms action delays. Do not collapse them or silently dispatch the composite once per physical hit.",
    "Native global shuffle, pitch, voice arbitration, default material routing and unresolved bus mix remain declarations, separate from any local runtime adapter.",
    "Canonical private float masters retain source samples/headroom without clipping, normalization, resampling, mixing or loop expansion. No official decoder/bus/listening certificate.",
    "No new decoding, public WAVs, runtime events, state/schema or native callback/bus/listening certificate. Selected masters retain the prior pinned canonical software decode.",
    "Ignored cache evidence and private masters require preservation; exact changed source files are archived separately."
  ]
